    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/276860f2dc97d4f19ac593e26f2ecbf9.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Device 0101 is a game made of RPG Maker MV.<br>You can enjoy adventures, puzzles, and battles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/f5db94cb921a095439706b577c6eb42c.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/a0d41bfb6032666229c3431b5cde1774.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fccf06f294af965ab83614a70450898f.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Risa argues with her father on her birthday and leaves the house angry. And head to a pojangmacha near the beach, the meeting place with friends who were supposed to meet on their birthdays. Risa and her friends celebrated her birthday drinking together. I don't know how long it's been since then, but Risa opens her eyes on the bed, not the pojangmacha, and the story begins.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/324d70d26f219c2df653c0fc0117a4c4.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/91e8287ba601d03d01b14626e9bb3912.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>By solving various puzzles, you can open hidden places and get a key to open a blocked way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/d35454fb0424814f929a3eee25004fcf.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/0e6f27233be85317d0bd108d7d40c286.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/400cf067f679ff80a66fcfdc9bc854ad.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Use weapons to kill monsters that interfere with your path.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.poster.avif?t=1721288495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.webm?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.mp4?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.poster.avif?t=1721288495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.webm?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.mp4?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/276860f2dc97d4f19ac593e26f2ecbf9.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Device 0101 is a game made of RPG Maker MV.<br>You can enjoy adventures, puzzles, and battles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/f5db94cb921a095439706b577c6eb42c.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/a0d41bfb6032666229c3431b5cde1774.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fccf06f294af965ab83614a70450898f.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Risa argues with her father on her birthday and leaves the house angry. And head to a pojangmacha near the beach, the meeting place with friends who were supposed to meet on their birthdays. Risa and her friends celebrated her birthday drinking together. I don't know how long it's been since then, but Risa opens her eyes on the bed, not the pojangmacha, and the story begins.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/324d70d26f219c2df653c0fc0117a4c4.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/91e8287ba601d03d01b14626e9bb3912.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>By solving various puzzles, you can open hidden places and get a key to open a blocked way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/d35454fb0424814f929a3eee25004fcf.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/0e6f27233be85317d0bd108d7d40c286.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/400cf067f679ff80a66fcfdc9bc854ad.avif?t=1721288495\" /></div><br><br>Use weapons to kill monsters that interfere with your path.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.poster.avif?t=1721288495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.webm?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/fb8347e4b81fe5ef1fd5a21caab874dd.mp4?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.poster.avif?t=1721288495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.webm?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792770/extras/01ebbab8dea1ef0976e7c4564e0f2a95.mp4?t=1721288495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
